Fonts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Three families are bundled in assets/fonts/ and ARE distributed with this program, copied into
Termisu.app/Contents/Resources/fonts/ by scripts/build-app.sh. Each licence text ships beside
the file it covers; assets/fonts/README.md records the provenance and the terms in full.

Cousine (SIL OFL 1.1), from google/fonts, ofl/cousine. Unmodified. The Hebrew face since
2026-08-25, when it replaced Miriam Mono CLM for stroke weight. Regular, Bold, Italic and
BoldItalic. LICENSE-Cousine-OFL.txt.
https://github.com/googlefonts/cousine

Kawkab Mono (SIL OFL 1.1), by Abdullah Arif, v0.501. Unmodified. Regular and Bold. The name
is reserved, so a modified copy must be renamed. LICENSE-KawkabMono-OFL.txt.
https://github.com/aiaf/kawkab-mono

JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (SIL OFL 1.1), the Nerd Fonts patched build of JetBrains Mono by
JetBrains s.r.o. Unmodified. Regular, Bold, Italic and BoldItalic, v3.5.1.
LICENSE-JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt.
https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts

